description: Prevent predefined catalogue and business data
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Predefined Data

- Do not add predefined medicines, tablets, pharmacies, orders, reminders, prescriptions, users, or other business records to the app.
- Customer-facing catalogue data must come from pharmacy uploads or user-created records at runtime.
- Empty states should clearly guide users to upload or create data instead of showing seed examples.
- Demo-only operational UI may simulate status, timing, progress, or telemetry, but must not include hardcoded medicine/pharmacy catalogue entries.
- If sample text is needed for placeholders, keep it generic, such as `Brand Name`, `Salt Name`, or `Pharmacy Name`.
